<title>USA: U.S. Mint seeks 270,000 kg of nickel.</title>
<headline>U.S. Mint seeks 270,000 kg of nickel.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Mint said Thursday it was seeking 270,000 kg of nickel cathodes or briquettes for delivery in the weeks starting November 11 or November 18.</p>
<p>The Mint said it would review offers at 1000 EDT/1400 GMT on October 22.</p>
<p>It said it sought 135,000 kg for delivery by truck to Olin Corp in East Alton, Illinois, and 135,000 kg for delivery by truck to PMX Industries Inc in Cedar Rapids, Iowa.</p>
<p>-- Washington Commodities Desk (202) 898-8489</p>
